    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/3dd91eeaa8ae2de1c14350dc3313e418.avif?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/b4b6d85c9cfb07608093f3670c6f5d4b.avif?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/5171a39e220336a204f6488a68e8715c.webp?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/41d4ada492acafabb7c0500381631af1.poster.avif?t=1749455260\" width=609 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/41d4ada492acafabb7c0500381631af1.webm?t=1749455260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEAST</strong> <strong>is a thrilling 3v3 multiplayer hero shooter</strong> where each match delivers quick and intense action with powerful Mechas! Choose your favorite character and dive into quick, action-packed games that offer easy, pick-up-and-play fun. <strong>BEAST</strong> offers a light-hearted, laid-back experience open to anyone, boasting quick matches full of excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/2907383dc7e618c1ed49ca431419da77.webp?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/8e0a110cd9494b7182974d5a4acbc90e.poster.avif?t=1749455260\" width=609 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/8e0a110cd9494b7182974d5a4acbc90e.webm?t=1749455260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic dual gameplay system. <strong>Switch seamlessly between your powerful MECHA for brute strength and your agile PET</strong> for nimble tactics, each offering unique skills that bring versatility and depth to every match! Seamless transitions and sharp strategy will turn the tide in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/1b580b6300c448f18c4990f46fe14f10.webp?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/fc42280e00a38098aae6324c3201677d.poster.avif?t=1749455260\" width=609 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/fc42280e00a38098aae6324c3201677d.webm?t=1749455260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>a roster of unique heroes</strong>, each with their own special abilities and playstyles. Whether you prefer heavy firepower, quick strikes, or strategic defense, there\u2019s a hero that fits your gameplay and adds a new dimension to every battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/298c003143cc9395fdb4704690fc1eec.webp?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/d4237f11051447767485b1ea858dfc25.poster.avif?t=1749455260\" width=609 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/d4237f11051447767485b1ea858dfc25.webm?t=1749455260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill matters most, not your wallet! <strong>With no microtransactions, BEAST guarantees a fair and balanced playing field for your progression</strong> where your abilities and achievements drive your success. It\u2019s all about your skills, strategy, and teamwork!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/7e39f71fcdaf144db9f06f32a15d7d37.webp?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/c07c66fafc62d4ec79a6c4cd369d064b.poster.avif?t=1749455260\" width=609 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/c07c66fafc62d4ec79a6c4cd369d064b.webm?t=1749455260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the excitement alive with<strong> a variety of game modes to explore and a rich solo adventure to dive into.</strong> Experiment with different hero synergies, switch to your BEAST form on the fly, and discover the best strategies to dominate the Arena. <strong>Whether you're testing your skills in multiplayer combat or uncovering each hero\u2019s story in solo mode, BEAST\u00a0offers endless ways to play!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/3dd91eeaa8ae2de1c14350dc3313e418.avif?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/b4b6d85c9cfb07608093f3670c6f5d4b.avif?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/5171a39e220336a204f6488a68e8715c.webp?t=1749455260\" width=610 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/41d4ada492acafabb7c0500381631af1.poster.avif?t=1749455260\" width=609 height=335 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/41d4ada492acafabb7c0500381631af1.webm?t=1749455260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEAST</strong> <strong>is a thrilling 3v3 multiplayer hero shooter</strong> where each match delivers quick and intense action with powerful Mechas! Choose your favorite character and dive into quick, action-packed games that offer easy, pick-up-and-play fun. <strong>BEAST</strong> offers a light-hearted, laid-back experience open to anyone, boasting quick matches full of excitement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239670/extras/2907383dc7e618c1ed49ca431419da77.w