to dive into.</strong> Experiment with different hero synergies, switch to your BEAST form on the fly, and discover the best strategies to dominate the Arena. <strong>Whether you're testing your skills in multiplayer combat or uncovering each hero\u2019s story in solo mode, BEAST\u00a0offers endless ways to play!</strong></p>",
